sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Orchestrator
    participant PIX as Etherfuse
    participant Stellar
    participant Circle

    User->>Orchestrator: Create transfer
    Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: BRL/USDC quote
    Note right of Orchestrator: CREATED → QUOTED

    Orchestrator->>PIX: Generate PIX charge
    PIX-->>User: BrCode
    User->>PIX: Pay (simulated)
    PIX-->>Orchestrator: Webhook (e2e_id)
    Note right of Orchestrator: PIX_FUNDED

    Orchestrator->>Stellar: Submit USDC payment
    Stellar-->>Orchestrator: Tx hash
    Note right of Orchestrator: STELLAR_SETTLED

    Orchestrator->>Circle: Wire payout $10
    Circle-->>Orchestrator: Payout ID + status
    Note right of Orchestrator: PAYOUT_INSTRUCTED

    Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: Reconcile amounts
    Note right of Orchestrator: RECONCILED
